trample However I please

174
00:20:17,180 --> 00:20:22,340
Bring Mamorosuke here I'll continue
to slaughter until that happens

175
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:28,877
Your country is finished Your children and

176
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:31,920
your children's children
will sink into despair.

177
