Let's butcher them while they're down!

183
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:52,751
It doesn't matter if you took out Big Mom!

184
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:55,037
You are never gonna meet Commander Kido!

185
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:56,700
